<title>USA: TomaHawk II Inc Q1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TomaHawk II Inc Q1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>TomaHawk II Inc, the U.S. unit of Tomahawk Corp said it incurred a net loss of $182,000, on sales of $1.34 million.</p>
<p>This compares with a net loss of $221,000 on revenues of $137,000 in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Results for the first quarter of 1997 represent significant growth for the company and include a net profit in March of $80,000 on sales of $638,000. The company also reported a contract backlog of about $25 million at March 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
